      "hizbQuarter": 163,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3452,
      "text": "Adhere sincerely to the true religion before there comes a Day that cannot be averted from Allah. On that Day people will be divided[19].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 30,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرُّومِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Room",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Romans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 409,
      "ruku": 353,
      "hizbQuarter": 163,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3453,
      "text": "Whoever disbelieves will bear [the burden of] his disbelief, and whoever does righteous deeds, they are preparing for themselves [a place in Paradise],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 30,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرُّومِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Room",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Romans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 44,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 409,
      "ruku": 353,
      "hizbQuarter": 163,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3454,
      "text": "so that He may reward those who believe and do righteous deeds out of His grace. Indeed, He does not like the disbelievers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 30,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرُّومِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Room",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Romans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 45,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 409,
      "ruku": 353,
      "hizbQuarter": 163,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3455,
      "text": "Among His signs is that He sends the winds as harbingers [of rain], so that He may give you a taste of His mercy, and that the ships may sail by His command, and that you may seek His bounty, and so that you may be grateful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 30,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرُّومِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Room",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Romans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 46,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 409,
      "ruku": 353,
      "hizbQuarter": 163,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3456,
      "text": "Indeed, We sent before you messengers to their people, and they came to them with clear signs. Then We took vengeance on those who persisted in wickedness, for it is incumbent upon Us to help the believers[20].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 30,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرُّومِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Room",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Romans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 47,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 409,
      "ruku": 353,
      "hizbQuarter": 163,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3457,
      "text": "It is Allah Who sends the winds that stir up clouds, then He spreads them in the sky as He wills, and He splits them into different fragments, and then you see the rain pouring down from their midst. Then as soon as He makes it fall upon whoever He wills of His slaves, they rejoice,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 30,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرُّومِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Room",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Romans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 48,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 409,
      "ruku": 353,
      "hizbQuarter": 163,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3458,
      "text": "although they had lost all hope before it was sent down to them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 30,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرُّومِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Room",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Romans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 409,
      "ruku": 353,
      "hizbQuarter": 163,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3459,
      "text": "See then the effects of Allah’s mercy, how He revives the earth after its death. Indeed, it is He Who will raise the dead, and He is Most Capable of all things.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 30,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرُّومِ",
